          "docs": "This endpoint is used to get a paginated collection of broadcasts under the specified account and list.  The sort order is dependent on the requested status.\n\n  * *draft* messages are sorted by `broadcast_id` **and** only include API created broadcast drafts\n  * *scheduled* messages are sorted by `scheduled_for`\n  * *sent* messages are sorted by `sent_at`\n\n\nCheck out related examples:\n\n  * Create and Schedule Broadcast (\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/aweber/public-api-examples/blob/master/pyth"
