          "docs": "This endpoint is used to retrieve a broadcast message's unique opens. If a subscriber has opened several times, the first open record will be returned for the subscriber.\nResults are returned in most recent order by event_time.\nThe subscriber's email address will only be returned if the token has the `subscriber.read` scope."
        },
