          },
          "docs": "This endpoint is used to retrieve a broadcast message's clicks.\nBy default, returns aggregated click data showing the first click per subscriber along with click statistics. When detailed=true, returns individual click events including the specific URLs that were clicked.\nResults are returned in most recent order by event_time.\nThe subscriber's email address will only be returned if the token has the `subscriber.read` scope."
